  "handle": "sofa-bite-2-seater-fabric-gunmetal-grey",
  "body_html": "<p>Meet the Bite Sofa: its got serious style and super comfy seating without needing a stadium-sized living room! The elegant tufted design sits atop beautiful gold accent legs for that irresistible, luxe touch.</p>\n\n<p>Go ahead, sink right in! The seating is built for relaxation, featuring expertly layered 6” foam over reliable zig-zag springs. That extra depth means you have the freedom to truly stretch out or just curl up for a movie marathon.</p>\n\n<p>We also have great news for clumsy folks! The 380 GSM fabric is both stain and water-repellant, making it the most worry-free piece of furniture for your home. Cleaning shouldn't be a workout and those elevated legs make vacuuming underneath a breeze. </p>\n\n<p>Ready to make this trendy sofa the statement piece for your living room?</p>",
